  "worked_solution": "We apply the distributive law on the right:\n\n$$\nAC-BC=(A-B)C.\n$$\n\nSo, compute $A-B$ first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-B & =[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 5 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 4 & 0\\end{aligned}]-[\\begin{aligned}-2 & -1 & 3 \\\\ 0 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 1 & 4 & -4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =4{I}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC-BC & =(A-B)C \\\\  & =(4{I}_{3})C \\\\  & =4C \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$",
